{"id":"en_the-godfather-s-wife-is-a-top-assassin","title":"The Godfather's Wife Is a Top Assassin","titleEn":"The Godfather's Wife Is a Top Assassin","description":"Elaine leads a quiet life as a kindergarten teacher, but behind that role she works as Phoenix, a highly skilled assassin. Her current assignment is to eliminate the mysterious Black Duke, a target she cannot seem to pin down. What she does not realize is that the Black Duke is actually Julian, her own husband. The situation unravels when Julian's lieutenant, whose fixation on him borders on obsession, uncovers their connection and subjects a pregnant Elaine to torture. Only when a broken necklace comes to light does the truth of their identities emerge, leaving them to confront whether their love can withstand the deception of their double lives. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-godfathers-wife-is-a-top-assassin/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-godfathers-wife-is-a-top-assassin/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mystery","Plot Twist","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9k3s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-godfather-s-wife-is-a-top-assassin_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9k3s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-godfather-s-wife-is-a-top-assassin_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d9k3s/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-godfather-s-wife-is-a-top-assassin_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)"